  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 50,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūbyalwa kwa ng'wa Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo shikafunyiwa shilagīlo na Kaisali Augusto, gīkī pye a banhū ū mu sī bandīkwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wenūbo būkabiza wandīkwa bo kwandya aho Kilenio alī nsugi wa Sulia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū pye a banhū būja kwandīkwa, būlī ng'wene kū nzengo go ng'wawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yosefu nang'hwe ūbūūka ī Galilaya, kūfuma mu nzengo gwa Nazaleti. Ūlinha kūja Būyudaya kū nzengo go ng'wa Daūdi, gwitanagwa Betelehemu, nguno walī wa numba ya ng'wa Daūdi na būbyīle bokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūja akandīkwe hamò nū Malia ūyo walī anūngije, ū mu shikū jenījo ū Malia ūsangwa alī nda nhaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho balī kwenūko lyūshikīīla ī likanza lyakwe lya kūbyala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbyala ng'wana ngosha; tangi wakwe. Ūnkumba myenda ya sheleele, hūna ūnaalīkīja ng'wilīīlo lya mitugo, nguno bakagayiwa ū ng'wanya ū mu numba ya bageni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bamalaika kū badīīmi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mhandī jenījo baalīho badīīmi ba ng'holo baalī lūgundīīga; baalī kū matogolo bakūlang'hanaga madale ga ng'holo jabo makanza ga būjikū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahayimanīla malaika o ng'wa Seeba obilongela, būpīndiwa na būpe w'ikūjo lya ng'wa Seeba, bogoha na kogohele kataale no! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū malaika ūbawīla gīkī, “Mutogohage nguno nang'wenhela Ng'hūlū Jawiza, ījo jikūbiza ja būyegi būtaale kū banhū bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lelo yenīyī, ū mu nzengo go ng'wa Daūdi ng'wabyalīlagwa Mpīja, Kilisito Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shimanīkījo shing'we shilī gīkī, mukūmona Ng'wana ng'weleele alingīīlilwe myenda ya sheleele, alaajiwe ng'wilīīlo lya mitugo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūhayimanīla lilonga ibita itaale lya ng'wigūlū, nū malaika ng'wenūyo wisanja nabo. Būnkumīlīja Mulungu balīhaya gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ikūjo lībize kūlī Mulungu higūlya no,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bamalaika aho bīnga baja ng'wigūlū, a badīīmi benabo biwīla gīkī, “Tūjagi ī Betelehemu tūkagūbone ū mhayo ūyo gwilongaga gwenūyū, ūyo watoolekeja ū Seeba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana bihuuta bajile ko, būūkansanga ū Malia nū Yosefu, hamò nū Ng'wana alaalile ng'wilīīlo lya mitugo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bamona ū Ng'wana bīsomboola ī mihayo yakwe, gīt'ūmo baalī bawīlīlwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye abo bakigwa īyo bakawīlwa na a badīīmi būkumya no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Malia wīsūmbya pyī ī mihayo yenīyo, wībīka mung'holò yakwe, ūyūyideedeng'hanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A badīīmi aho bībona pyī ī yenīyo, būshoka balīnkumīlīja Mulungu, na kūngongoola. Nguno īyo baalī bawīlwa bakībona ī yose, gīkī yalī gīt'ūmo baalī bigwīla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu kwenhwa mu hekalu ha weleele",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ng'wana aho washisha shikū inaane būnsaala, būng'winha ī lina lyakwe ī lya Yesu, īlo walī winhwa na malaika kūko ataalī nūūlū kūtungīlwa nda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jahayūshika ī shikū ja kwejiwa kwabo, būntwala Yelusalemu kūjūntūūla kū būtongi bo ng'wa Seeba, gīt'ūmo shihayīlile shilagīlo sha ng'wa Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo yandīkīlilwe mu shilagīlo sha ng'wa Seeba, gīkī, “Būlī ng'wana ngosha ū wa kūhangūla nda ya ng'wa nina, akwitanwa alī ng'wela kūlī Seeba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būfunya na shitambo gīt'ūmo shilagīlo sha ng'wa Seeba shihayīlile: Ng'hūūlū ibīlī, nūūlū ng'hune ibīlī ja mhunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu Yelusalemu walīmo ngosha witanagwa Simioni, munhū ntūngīlīja na wa logohano. Walī akūlindīīlile ū kūlūngūjiwa kwa Baisilaeli; nū Moyo Ng'wela walī hamò nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū Moyo Ng'wela walī wamanīkīja gīkī, atūcha aho ataalī kūmona Kilisito",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:26",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kilisito:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shiyunani Kilisito, Shihebulania Masīya; lina h'ī līmò. O ng'wa Seeba.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Moyo ūtongeela ū munhū ng'wenūyo kūja kū hekalu, ūūkingīla mo. Aho bang'wenha a babyaji bakwe ū Ng'wana ū Yesu, kwiza kwītīlwa gīt'ūmo shalī shīmīle sha shilagīlo, ū munhū ng'wenūyo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūng'wanukūla ū Ng'wana mu makono gakwe. Hūna ūnkumīlīja Mulungu alīhaya gīkī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
