          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Seeba ī haha lūūlū",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ise nū nina wa Ng'wana bakīkumya īyo īkahayiwa kūlwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Simioni ng'wenūyo ūbafuuha. Ū nina ū Malia ū ng'wene ūng'wīla, “Managa gīkī, ū Ng'wana ng'wenūyū ahelelilwe nīmo ūyo gūkwenheleja banhū bingī ū mu Baisilaeli kūgwa, na bangī kūgūngūmūka; hama akūbiza shimanīkījo sha kwihalalījiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī maganiko gang'holò ja banhū bingī gakūtendwa ha ng'wape; nīyo nū bebe ū būpanga boko būkūching'wa līlūshū!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walīho na ng'hangi nkīma, Ana ng'wana Fanueli; ngikūlū o shikū ningī, o lūganda lo ng'wa Asheli. A ha būnhya bokwe walī watoolwa, wikala nū ngoshi ikanza lya myaka mpungatī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūchīlwa! Hūna wikala gīko dūhū atatoolilwe, kūshisha myaka makūmi anaane n'īne. Walī atīngaga ū mu hekalu, wikalaga ng'wenūmo līīmi ji na būjikū pe; nīmo gokwe kūlomba na kūfunga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ī likanza lyenīlo wiza hoi, ūbawīla ī mihayo ya Ng'wana ng'wenūyo, pye a bana Yelusalemu abo baalī balindīīlile būpīji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūshoka Nazaleti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bīmala pyī ī myanya gīt'ūmo shalī shihayīlile ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa Seeba, būshoka Galilaya kū nzengo gwabo gwa Nazaleti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ng'wana ūkūla, ūbiza na nguzu, na a masala ūkwīja no, hama nī lubango ja ng'wa Mulungu jalī hamò nang'hwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu mu hekalu ha būdinha bokwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī ng'waka a babyaji bakwe bajaga Yelusalemu, kū shigukulu sha pasaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a haho washisha myaka ikūmi n'ībīlī, būlinha bajile ko gīt'ūmo shalī shīmīle sha shigukulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho jang'wa ī shikū ja shigukulu, būbūūka kūshoka kaya. Alīyo ū ndinha ū Yesu ūsaaga Yelusalemu, gwike a babyaji bakwe baalī batamanile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būshimīza lūgendo lwa lūshikū lūgima, baliganika gīkī nang'hwe alīmo dūhū ū ng'wibita lya banhū. Bahayūngayiwa, bandya kūnkooba ū mu badūgū nū mu bimane babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho baduuma ū kūmona, būshoka ī Yelusalemu bakūnkoobaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jūbīta shikū idatū, bahayūja kū hekalu būūkansangīla mo, wigashaga na balangi, alībadegeleka na kūyūbabūja mabūjo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye abo bang'wigwaga babūkumyaga ū witegeleja bokwe, na a mashosho gakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A babyaji bakwe aho bamona būdedebala! Ū nina ūng'wīla gīkī, “Bebe Ng'wana, nibūlī watwītīlile mhayo gūlī gīko? Ū nene nū so watūpīnīhagije no, tūkūkūkoobaga!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbashokeja ūbawīla, “Nibūlī mulīnikooba? Mutamanile gīkī shinigeleelilwe kūbiza mu numba ya ng'wa Baba?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike batagwitegelegije ū mhayo ūyo akabawīla gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūshoka nabo, būtulumenha bajile ī Nazaleti, ūyūbigwa mu yose. Ū nina wībīka mung'holò yakwe pyī ī yenīyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu ūkūla, ongeja ū mu witegeleja, nū mu kūnyeja ū Mulungu, na a banhū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
